### Integration: Ammar's Search desk asks Daniel's desk "is this user active?"
### Needs BOTH running: admin-api on 3003 and search-api on 3002.
### Ammar's desk remembers each answer for 60 seconds, so wait 1 minute after suspending.

@admin = http://localhost:3003
@search = http://localhost:3002
@ticket = XXXX.DUMMY.TOKEN.XXXX
@studentId = 91e47e82-ed87-4e12-b7d8-83ac4f3f91c8

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
@studentToken = {{studentLogin.response.body.token}}

### I1. Admin logs in at Daniel's desk  -> 200 token
# @name adminLogin
POST {{admin}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Turnstile-Token: {{ticket}}

{ "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_TEST_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_TEST_PASSWORD}}" }

### I2. Student logs in at Daniel's desk  -> 200 token
# @name studentLogin
POST {{admin}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Turnstile-Token: {{ticket}}

{ "email": "daniel.test.student@example.com", "password": "Student123" }

### I3. Student searches at AMMAR's desk  -> 200 with alumni results
### (Ammar's desk accepted Daniel's badge AND got "active" from Daniel's phone line)
GET {{search}}/api/alumni?q=software
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### I4. Admin suspends the student at Daniel's desk  -> 200 "Account suspended."
PATCH {{admin}}/api/admin/users/{{studentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "suspended" }

### I5. WAIT 1 MINUTE, then the student searches again  -> 403 ACCOUNT_INACTIVE
### (her badge is still valid, but Daniel's desk now says "suspended")
GET {{search}}/api/alumni?q=software
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### I6. Admin reactivates the student  -> 200 "Account reactivated."
PATCH {{admin}}/api/admin/users/{{studentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "active" }

### I7. WAIT 1 MINUTE, then search again  -> 200 results again
GET {{search}}/api/alumni?q=software
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}